---
import { CONTACT_EMAIL, GITHUB_URL } from '../consts';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Contact" description="JUSIAI GAMES에 연락하는 방법">
  <header class="page-head">
    <h1 class="jg-underline">Contact</h1>
    <p>게임 문의, 협업 제안, 버그 제보 모두 환영합니다.</p>
  </header>

  <ul class="channels">
    <li class="channel">
      <span class="jg-badge">EMAIL</span>
      <a class="channel__value" href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>
      <p>가장 확실한 연락 방법입니다.</p>
      <button class="jg-btn jg-btn--secondary jg-btn--sm" type="button" data-copy={CONTACT_EMAIL}>주소 복사</button>
    </li>
    <li class="channel">
      <span class="jg-badge jg-badge--coral">GITHUB</span>
      <a class="channel__value" href={GITHUB_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">github.com/jusiai-games</a>
      <p>이 블로그와 공개 프로젝트의 소스 코드가 있습니다. 블로그 오류는 이슈로 알려 주세요.</p>
    </li>
  </ul>
</BaseLayout>

<script>
  for (const button of document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-copy]')) {
    button.addEventListener('click', async () => {
      const text = button.dataset.copy ?? '';
      const original = button.textContent;
      try {
        await navigator.clipboard.writeText(text);
        button.textContent = '복사했습니다';
      } catch {
        button.textContent = text;
      }
      setTimeout(() => (button.textContent = original), 2000);
    });
  }
</script>

<style>
  .channels {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-6);
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }
  .channel {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    padding: var(--space-6);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    background: var(--card);
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .channel__value {
    font-size: 20px;
    line-height: 28px;
    font-weight: 700;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  .channel p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 22px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .channels {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }
  }
</style>
